ook’s ","type":"text"},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI. One helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/searchable(text:placement:prompt:)-7d051":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/searchable(text:placement:prompt:)-7d051","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/searchable(text:placement:prompt:)-7d051","title":"searchable(text:placement:prompt:)","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"searchable","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"text","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Binding","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI7BindingV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"placement","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SearchFieldPlacement","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI20SearchFieldPlacementV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"prompt","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LocalizedStringKey","preciseI